      <p class="citation">Marketing automation ROI equals (annual time savings + revenue lift − platform cost) ÷ platform cost × 100. Nucleus Research found an average return of $5.44 per $1 spent over three years, with payback in under six months. Team size, lead volume and platform price decide the result.</p>
